# Local MLflow tracking store (created when you train or start the UI)
# Default layout written in the repo root:
#   mlflow.db          SQLite backend (experiments, runs, model registry)
#   mlruns/            run artifacts when using the file/SQLite store directly
#   mlartifacts/       artifacts when using `mlflow server --default-artifact-root`
